# THE TETHER (src/core/orbit/tether.gd, orbit_sky.gdshaderinc): one hair-thin
# line off the far shore's horizon up to the Foundry, a small steady light fixed
# in the sky, a climber's lamp going up it at night; the ring, lower and dead,
# passing by. Over the shoulder at the eye, turned to the far shore: seed 1's
# Tether stands at bearing 235 (`--stats`: "world tether"), and the staged pass
# rises on that bearing and stands 54 degrees up at 23:00, on the line.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/tether.tour --seed=1 --place=coast --weather=clear:0 --eye=1.7,-30,70 --face=235 --orbit=zenith@1512/235
hour 6.3
wait 2
shot 01-dawn with tether
hour 12
wait 2
shot 02-noon with tether
hour 23
wait 2
await ring 10
shot 03-a-ring-pass-at-night with tether
